      "x": 515,
      "y": 325,
      "width": 305,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "\"When I worked remotely at Google during\n2020-2022, my design output doubled. I had\nfewer interruptions and could focus on deep\nwork. My best designs came from those\nuninterrupted morning sessions at home.\n\nCollaboration happened async via Figma\ncomments, which actually improved clarity.\"",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent"
    },

